{"nodes": [{"id": "gantt_ganttview_ganttview", "label": "GanttView", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "/home/stanislasius/Projects/Personal/obsidian-pm/src/views/gantt/GanttView.ts", "source_location": 29, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left task-label panel + right timeline split with a draggable label-width resize handle (clamped 150-600px). The header lives in its own SVG inside a sticky wrapper that shares the right panel's horizontal scroll (tracks left/right) but pins on vertical scroll; the body's top band is tucked under the sticky header with a negative margin. A left spacer compensates for the right panel's horizontal scrollbar height so rows don't desync. Wheel events from the left panel are forwarded to the scroll container. Keyboard handling (Escape cancels linking, Ctrl/Cmd+Z/Y undo/redo) only fires when the gantt leaf is the active workspace leaf so note editing is never hijacked. Scroll position (top + anchor date) is saved and restored so ProjectView can preserve position across view switches."}], "edges": [{"source": "gantt_ganttview_ganttview", "target": "gantt_ganttheaderrenderer_rendertimelineheader", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "/home/stanislasius/Projects/Personal/obsidian-pm/src/views/gantt/GanttView.ts", "source_location": 221, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "gantt_ganttview_ganttview", "target": "gantt_ganttrenderer_rendergridlines", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "/home/stanislasius/Projects/Personal/obsidian-pm/src/views/gantt/GanttView.ts", "source_location": 222, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "gantt_ganttview_ganttview", "target": "gantt_ganttrenderer_rendertodayline", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "/home/stanislasius/Projects/Personal/obsidian-pm/src/views/gantt/GanttView.ts", "source_location": 223, "weight